msgstr "**节点1**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:315
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1320
msgid ""
"Key Parameter Descriptions (in addition to [Single-Node "
"Deployment](#5111-single-node-deployment)):"
msgstr "关键参数说明（除[单节点部署](#5111-single-node-deployment)外）："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:317
msgid "**Multi-node network and data parallel configuration:**"
msgstr "**多节点网络和数据并行配置：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:319
msgid ""
"`HCCL_IF_IP`, `GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`, "
"`HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`: Network interface configuration for multi-node "
"communication. Set `nic_name` to the network interface name (obtained via "
"`ifconfig`) and `local_ip` to the current node's IP address. These must be "
"correctly configured on each node for successful multi-node communication."
msgstr ""
"`HCCL_IF_IP`、`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`：多节点通信的网络接口配置。将`nic_name`设置为网络接口名称（通过`ifconfig`获取），将`local_ip`设置为当前节点的IP地址。每个节点上必须正确配置这些参数才能实现成功的多节点通信。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:320
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size 4`: Total number of data parallel ranks across all "
"nodes (2 ranks per node in this scenario)."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-size 4`：所有节点上的数据并行秩总数（此场景中每个节点2个秩）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:321
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size-local 2`: Number of data parallel ranks on the current"
" node."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-size-local 2`：当前节点上的数据并行秩数量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:322
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-start-rank`: Starting rank offset for data parallel ranks "
"on this node. Node 0 uses `0`, node 1 uses `2`."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-start-rank`：此节点上数据并行秩的起始秩偏移。节点0使用`0`，节点1使用`2`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:323
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-address`: IP address of the data parallel master node (node"
" 0). Must match the `local_ip` of the master node."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-address`：数据并行主节点（节点0）的IP地址。必须与主节点的`local_ip`匹配。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:324
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-rpc-port 12980`: RPC port for data parallel master "
"communication. Must be the same across all nodes."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-rpc-port 12980`：数据并行主节点通信的RPC端口。所有节点必须保持一致。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:325
msgid ""
"`--headless`: Indicates a non-master node (used on node 1). Do not use on "
"node 0."
msgstr "`--headless`：表示非主节点（在节点1上使用）。不要在节点0上使用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:327
msgid ""
"**Notice:** This scenario enables `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1` (fused "
"`dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe` operators). Fused MC2 conflicts with "
"`multistream_overlap_shared_expert` — the two optimizations must not be "
"enabled at the same time (the runtime forcibly disables "
"`multistream_overlap_shared_expert` when fused MC2 is on)."
msgstr ""
"**注意：** 此场景启用了 `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`（融合的 "
"`dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe` 算子）。融合 MC2 与 "
"`multistream_overlap_shared_expert` 存在冲突——这两种优化不能同时启用（当融合 MC2 开启时，运行时将强制禁用 "
"`multistream_overlap_shared_expert`）。"

