msgid ""
"Prefill nodes — run on `$node_p0_ip`, `$node_p1_ip`, `$node_p2_ip`, "
"`$node_p3_ip` with `--dp-rank-start` `0/1/2/3`:"
msgstr ""
"预填充节点 — 在 `$node_p0_ip`、`$node_p1_ip`、`$node_p2_ip`、`$node_p3_ip` 上运行，并指定 "
"`--dp-rank-start` 为 `0/1/2/3`："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1185
msgid ""
"Decode nodes — run on `$node_d0_ip`, `$node_d1_ip`, `$node_d2_ip`, "
"`$node_d3_ip` with `--dp-rank-start` `0/2/4/6`:"
msgstr ""
"解码节点 — 在 `$node_d0_ip`、`$node_d1_ip`、`$node_d2_ip`、`$node_d3_ip` 上运行，使用 "
"`--dp-rank-start` 参数 `0/2/4/6`："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1194
msgid ""
"For request forwarding on this 8-node A2 layout, use 4 prefiller hosts (1 "
"endpoint each) and 4 decoder hosts (2 endpoints each) in the Request "
"Forwarding command below."
msgstr "对于此8节点A2布局的请求转发，请在下面的请求转发命令中使用4个预填充主机（每个1个端点）和4个解码主机（每个2个端点）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"Key Parameter Descriptions (in addition to [Prefill-Decode "
"Disaggregation](#5113-prefill-decode-disaggregation)):"
msgstr "关键参数说明（除 [预填充-解码分离](#5113-prefill-decode-disaggregation) 中所述之外）："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1229
msgid ""
"This 8-node A2 layout splits the global P/D topology across 8 Atlas 800 A2 "
"nodes: 4 prefill nodes hosting 1 DP rank each (8 cards per rank, `DP4 TP8`) "
"and 4 decode nodes hosting 2 DP ranks each (4 cards per rank, `DP8 TP4`). "
"The `launch_online_dp.py` script is the same as in [Prefill-Decode "
"Disaggregation](#5113-prefill-decode-disaggregation)."
msgstr ""
"此 8 节点 A2 布局将全局 P/D 拓扑分布在 8 台 Atlas 800 A2 节点上：4 个预填充节点各承载 1 个 DP rank（每个 "
"rank 8 张卡，`DP4 TP8`），4 个解码节点各承载 2 个 DP rank（每个 rank 4 张卡，`DP8 "
"TP4`）。`launch_online_dp.py` 脚本与 [预填充-解码分离](#5113-prefill-decode-"
"disaggregation) 中的相同。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1231
msgid "**Prefill node-specific configurations (A2):**"
msgstr "**预填充节点专用配置（A2）：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1233
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--additional-config '{\"enable_sparse_sfa_c8\": true, "
"\"enable_sparse_li_c8\": true, ...}'`: Both SFA C8 optimizations are enabled"
" in this scenario (vs. `enable_sparse_sfa_c8: false` in the A3 co-located "
"scenarios)."
msgstr ""
"`--additional-config '{\"enable_sparse_sfa_c8\": true, "
"\"enable_sparse_li_c8\": true, ...}'`：在此场景中启用了两种 SFA C8 优化（而在 A3 共置场景中为 "
"`enable_sparse_sfa_c8: false`）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1235
msgid "**Decode node-specific configurations (A2):**"
msgstr "**解码节点专用配置（A2）：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1237
msgid ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`: MLAPO fusion on decode nodes for memory-"
"bandwidth-bound token generation."
msgstr "`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`：在解码节点上启用 MLAPO 融合，用于内存带宽受限的 token 生成。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1238
msgid ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens 256`: Small batch token limit on decode nodes."
msgstr "`--max-num-batched-tokens 256`：解码节点上的小批量 token 限制。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1240
msgid ""
"**Multi-connector KV transfer configuration (`--kv-transfer-config`):**"
msgstr "**多连接器 KV 传输配置（`--kv-transfer-config`）：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1242
msgid ""
"`\"kv_connector\": \"MultiConnector\"`: Combines multiple KV transfer "
"connectors."
msgstr "`\"kv_connector\": \"MultiConnector\"`：组合多个 KV 传输连接器。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1243
msgid ""
"`MooncakeConnectorV1`: Mooncake KV cache transfer between prefill and decode"
" nodes (same role as in [Prefill-Decode Disaggregation](#5113-prefill-"
"decode-disaggregation))."
msgstr ""
"`MooncakeConnectorV1`：预填充和解码节点之间的 Mooncake KV 缓存传输（与 [预填充-"
"解码分离](#5113-prefill-decode-disaggregation) 中的角色相同）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1244
msgid ""
"`AscendStoreConnector`: The KV Cache Pool (Ascend Store) connector, "
"available since v0.23.0 — see the [KV Cache Pool (Ascend Store) Deployment "
"Guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/zh-"
"cn/latest/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.html)."
msgstr ""
"`AscendStoreConnector`：KV 缓存池（Ascend Store）连接器，自 v0.23.0 起可用——参见 [KV "
"缓存池（Ascend Store）部署指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/zh-"
"cn/latest/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.html)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1245
msgid ""
"`\"kv_load_failure_policy\": \"recompute\"`: When a KV block fails to load "
"from the KV pool, the request falls back to recomputation instead of "
"failing."
msgstr "`\"kv_load_failure_policy\": \"recompute\"`：当 KV 块从 KV 池加载失败时，请求回退到重计算而不是失败。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1246
msgid ""
"`\"load_async\": true` (decode side): Asynchronously loads KV cache from the"
" pool on decode nodes."
msgstr "`\"load_async\": true`（解码侧）：在解码节点上从池中异步加载 KV 缓存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1247
msgid "`\"backend\": \"mooncake\"`: The Ascend Store backend used by the connector."
msgstr "`\"backend\": \"mooncake\"`：连接器使用的 Ascend Store 后端。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1249
msgid "**Environment variables for the A2 PD scenario:**"
msgstr "**A2 PD 场景的环境变量：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1251
msgid "`VLLM_USE_V1=1`: Forces the v1 scheduler."
msgstr "`VLLM_USE_V1=1`：强制使用 v1 调度器。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1252
msgid ""
"`ASCEND_AGGREGATE_ENABLE=1` / `ASCEND_TRANSPORT_PRINT=1`: Communication "
"aggregation and transport debug printing."
msgstr "`ASCEND_AGGREGATE_ENABLE=1` / `ASCEND_TRANSPORT_PRINT=1`：通信聚合和传输调试打印。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1253
msgid ""
"`PYTHONHASHSEED=0`: Fixed hash seed for reproducible distributed scheduling."
msgstr "`PYTHONHASHSEED=0`：用于可复现分布式调度的固定哈希种子。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1254
msgid ""
"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_PATH=\"/mnt/share/scripts/mooncake.json\"`: Path to the "
"Mooncake configuration file (must exist on each node)."
msgstr ""
"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_PATH=\"/mnt/share/scripts/mooncake.json\"`：Mooncake "
"配置文件的路径（必须存在于每个节点上）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1255
msgid ""
"`HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE=1`: Enables HCCL intra-node communication over RoCE."
msgstr "`HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE=1`：启用通过 RoCE 的 HCCL 节点内通信。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1256
msgid "`ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1`: ACL operator initialization mode."
msgstr "`ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1`：ACL 算子初始化模式。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1257
msgid ""
"`VLLM_HOST_IP=$local_ip`: Host IP advertised by the decode engine for cross-"
"node communication."
msgstr "`VLLM_HOST_IP=$local_ip`：解码引擎为跨节点通信通告的主机 IP。"

